+---
+id: task-001-give-each-task-a-unique-id
+type: task
+title: "Give each task a unique id"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Each task now has a unique `id`, stable across renames.
+
+- `add` returns the task with an `id` (`task-1`, `task-2`, ...), taken from a counter of the list.
+- `get(id)` returns the task as a `Result`; `not-found` when there is none.
+- `find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag` and `remove` accept an id or a title.
+- Tests added in `test/list.test.ts`; `npm test` passes.
